    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“We’re going to step forward now. No one panics.”</em></p><p>As a <strong>bonus action</strong>, you may choose one ally within <strong>6 squares</strong> who can see or hear you.</p><ul><li>That ally can immediately move up to <strong>2 squares</strong> without provoking opportunity attacks.</li><li>Until the start of your next turn, that ally gains a <strong>+1 bonus to Guard</strong>.</li></ul><p>This is not a charge; it’s a deliberate advance.</p>",
